{
    "chapter_num": 1,
    "verses_count": 26,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Prologue"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "The former account I made, O Theophilus, of all that Jesus began both to do and teach, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "until the day in which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "He ascended into heaven."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He was taken up, after He through the Holy Spirit had given commandments to the apostles whom He had chosen, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to whom He also presented Himself alive after His suffering by many "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "unmistakable"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "infallible proofs, being seen by them during forty days and speaking of the things pertaining to the kingdom of God."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Holy Spirit Promised"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And being assembled together with "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "them,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " He commanded them not to depart from Jerusalem, but to wait for the Promise of the Father, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“which,”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "He said,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“you have"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "heard from Me;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "for John truly baptized with water,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "but you shall be baptized with the Holy Spirit not many days from now.”"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, when they had come together, they asked Him, saying, “Lord, will You at this time restore the kingdom to Israel?” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And He said to them, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "“It is not for you to"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "know times or seasons which the Father has put in His own authority."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "But you shall receive power"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "when the Holy Spirit has come upon you; and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "you shall be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU My witnesses"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "witnesses to Me in Jerusalem, and in all Judea and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "Samaria, and to the"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "WORDS_OF_JESUS",
                            "text": "end of the earth.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Jesus Ascends to Heaven"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now when He had spoken these things, while they watched, He was taken up, and a cloud received Him out of their sight. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And while they looked steadfastly toward heaven as He went up, behold, two men stood by them in white apparel, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who also said, “Men of Galilee, why do you stand gazing up into heaven? This "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "same"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Jesus, who was taken up from you into heaven, will so come in like manner as you saw Him go into heaven.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Upper Room Prayer Meeting"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they returned to Jerusalem from the mount called Olivet, which is near Jerusalem, a Sabbath day’s journey. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And when they had entered, they went up into the upper room where they were staying: Peter, James, John, and Andrew; Philip and Thomas; Bartholomew and Matthew; James "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the son"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of Alphaeus and Simon the Zealot; and Judas "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the son"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of James. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "These all continued with one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "purpose or mind"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "accord in prayer "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits and supplication"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and supplication, with the women and Mary the mother of Jesus, and with His brothers."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Matthias Chosen"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And in those days Peter stood up in the midst of the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU brethren"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "disciples (altogether the number of names was about a hundred and twenty), and said, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Men "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "and"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " brethren, this Scripture had to be fulfilled, which the Holy Spirit spoke before by the mouth of David concerning Judas, who became a guide to those who arrested Jesus; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for he was numbered with us and obtained a part in this ministry.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "(Now this man purchased a field with the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "reward of unrighteousness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "wages of iniquity; and falling headlong, he burst open in the middle and all his "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "intestines"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "entrails gushed out. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And it became known to all those dwelling in Jerusalem; so that field is called in their own language, Akel Dama, that is, Field of Blood.)"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“For it is written in the Book of Psalms:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "‘Let his dwelling place be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "deserted"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "desolate,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "And let no one live in it’"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": ";"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "‘Let another take his"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Gr. episkopen, position of overseer"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "office.’"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "“Therefore, of these men who have accompanied us all the time that the Lord Jesus went in and out among us, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 22,
                    "num_str": "22",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "beginning from the baptism of John to that day when He was taken up from us, one of these must become a witness with us of His resurrection.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 23,
                    "num_str": "23",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they proposed two: Joseph called Barsabas, who was surnamed Justus, and Matthias. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 24,
                    "num_str": "24",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they prayed and said, “You, O Lord, who know the hearts of all, show which of these two You have chosen "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 25,
                    "num_str": "25",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "to take part in this ministry and apostleship from which Judas by transgression fell, that he might go to his own place.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 26,
                    "num_str": "26",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they cast their lots, and the lot fell on Matthias. And he was numbered with the eleven apostles."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}